Require Cuby4 & MOPAC

Version : 
Cuby Version4 : http://cuby4.molecular.cz/, Jan Řezáč, https://doi.org/10.1002/jcc.24312
MOPAC 23.0.2 : https://openmopac.net/ Jonathan E. Moussa and James J. P. Stewar. https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.08025


Run the following command for the receptor, the complex and the free conformation of the ligand :

cuby4 cuby.in

The score is the difference between Ecomplex - (Ereceptor + Eligand)
